# The round pipeline's credentials file: copy it to .env beside round.sh
# (git ignores .env) and fill in the values a `secret` step types. One
# NAME=value per line, the value as it is, no quotes.

# Gemini CLI: a Google AI Studio API key of the throwaway account, in a
# project with billing enabled (lab/round/README.md, "Accounts").
GEMINI_API_KEY=
